' For listening (A6): the rooms' films and effects over the music
' (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 0 music remaster map_music 2`, New
' Sandez). The pub's film (the pub's song) 10 s, the pub 6 s; the trader's
' film (`sounds/trader.ogg` once, over silence) 10 s, the trader (his song)
' 8 s; the town 8 s.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 300
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 300
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub's film
wait 600
press escape             ' the pub
wait 360
esc
wait 120
mapclick 224,305         ' the trader's film
wait 600
press space              ' the trader
wait 480
esc                      ' the town
wait 480
quit
